{%- comment -%}
  Legal guarantee, inside the Details accordion stack.

  Two different obligations, and they are not the same thing:

  - GOODS. Implementing Reg. (EU) 2025/1960, applying from 27 Sep 2026: the official harmonised
    notice, shown before the consumer is bound. It is a fixed graphic — text, colours, layout and
    the QR code are prescribed. **Nothing about the image may be changed**: not recoloured to the
    brand palette, not rebuilt as HTML, not cropped. That is why a blue-and-white EU block appears
    in a design system that otherwise has no blue. The artwork is the Commission's own, one file
    per language.
  - DIGITAL CONTENT. Dir. (EU) 2019/770: the consumer is reminded of the legal guarantee, but there
    is **no harmonised template**, so that one is our own words and carries no image. Showing the
    goods notice next to an eBook would say something untrue.

  A product with both kinds of variant (Prague: printed + digital) shows both, always. No JS and no
  variant toggling on purpose: over-disclosure costs nothing, a toggle that breaks costs a lot.

  Sits in the accordion so the notice is one tap away from the words "Legal guarantee" — which is
  what the Commission's guidance asks for, and why it is not buried in the Terms any more.
  See docs/legal/legal-guarantee-notice.md.

  Accepts: product
{%- endcomment -%}
{%- liquid
  assign physical = product.variants | where: 'requires_shipping', true
  assign digital = product.variants | where: 'requires_shipping', false
  comment
    One artwork per language, and the two are not the same shape — the Slovak sets wider and
    shorter. The intrinsic size travels with the file, or the box reserved before the image loads
    is the wrong shape and the accordion jumps.
  endcomment
  assign notice = 'eu-legal-guarantee-notice-en.jpg'
  assign notice_w = 1186
  assign notice_h = 1675
  if request.locale.iso_code == 'sk'
    assign notice = 'eu-legal-guarantee-notice-sk.jpg'
    assign notice_w = 1215
    assign notice_h = 1569
  endif
-%}

{%- if physical.size > 0 -%}
  <p class="wui-guarantee__lead">{{ 'walterin.legal_guarantee.goods' | t }}</p>
  <figure class="wui-guarantee__notice">
    <img
      src="{{ notice | asset_url }}"
      alt="{{ 'walterin.legal_guarantee.alt' | t | escape }}"
      width="{{ notice_w }}"
      height="{{ notice_h }}"
      loading="lazy"
      decoding="async"
    >
  </figure>
  <p class="wui-guarantee__more">
    <a href="https://europa.eu/youreurope/guarantees" rel="noopener" target="_blank">{{ 'walterin.legal_guarantee.more' | t }}</a>
  </p>
{%- endif -%}

{%- if digital.size > 0 -%}
  <p class="wui-guarantee__digital">{{ 'walterin.legal_guarantee.digital' | t }}</p>
{%- endif -%}
